{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060843/block/singleImage/3251579/df/01M61FJKESTT18NK1Y3J3HDJFX.jpg?updatedAt=1793198815\"/><figcaption>嘉湖山莊本月買賣創5個月新高 兩房成交呎價9372元｜藍籌屋苑</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，藍籌屋苑天水圍嘉湖山莊本月成交價量齊升，暫錄得 27 宗買賣，較上月升 42% ，創 5 個月新高；平均呎價約 8,509 元，按月升 0.5% 。 伍耀祖指，嘉湖山莊最新錄得景湖居 4 座高層 E 室成交，單位實用面積約 446 方呎，兩房間隔，向東南，景致開揚，原開價 438 萬元放售，經議價後減價 20 萬元，以 418 萬元沽出，呎價約 9,372 元。 伍耀祖續指，原業主早於 1995 年以 139 萬元買入單位，持貨約 31 年轉售，帳面獲利 279 萬元，單位期內升值約 2 倍。</p><p>即睇天水圍嘉湖山莊放盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060843/block/singleImage/3251581/wm/01M61FKFTBA2XN0YGKAHES9HVY.jpg?updatedAt=1793198815\"/><figcaption>嘉湖山莊本月成交價量齊升，暫錄得27宗買賣，較上月升42%，創5個月新高。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:29.373755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T20:18:11.681402+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:20.303173+00:00","content_hash":"3e9be63a246b57d541e3490bfe9af527dd2701df18517225ac811d9c41d57bf5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:29.373755+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}